  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Aid Direct Fund - working with small and medium charities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide competitive funding to UK and overseas-based small and medium-sized civil society organisations , to support them in contributing to the decline of  poverty in a range of the poorest countries, working towards the achievement of the Millennium Development Goals (MDGs) and the post-2015 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs).</narrative>
  </description>
